sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Order Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant D as Delivery Service
    participant ODB as order_db
    participant DDB as delivery_db

    O->>ODB: Save order (status: PLACED)
    O->>MQ: Publish OrderPlacedEvent

    MQ-->>D: Consume OrderPlacedEvent
    D->>DDB: Create delivery (status: ASSIGNED)
    D->>MQ: Publish DeliveryStatusUpdatedEvent

    MQ-->>O: Consume DeliveryStatusUpdatedEvent
    O->>ODB: Update order status (OUT_FOR_DELIVERY)

    Note over O,MQ: If consumer unavailable, message stays queued until recovery
